# HEX Software — Internship Projects

This repository contains data analysis and visualization projects completed during my internship at **HEX Software**.

---

## Projects

### 1. Titanic Survival Analysis (`Titanic_Analysis.ipynb`)
Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on the Titanic dataset using Pandas, Seaborn, and Matplotlib. Includes data cleaning, feature engineering, survival rate analysis by class/sex/age, and correlation heatmaps.

### 2. COVID-19 Data Analysis (`Covid19_Analysis.ipynb`)
Comprehensive analysis of the global COVID-19 pandemic using real-time data from **Our World in Data**. Covers:
- Global daily trends (cases, deaths, vaccinations)
- Top affected countries comparison
- Vaccination rate vs death rate correlation
- Infection Fatality Rate (IFR) analysis by continent and demographics
- Reproduction rate trends for major countries
- Correlation between COVID-19 metrics and socioeconomic factors

### 3. YouTube Data Dashboard (`youtube_dashboard.py`)
Interactive Streamlit dashboard for YouTube channel analytics:
- Key performance indicators (subscribers, views, videos)
- Top-performing videos with sortable bar charts (views, likes, comments, engagement rate)
- Subscriber growth trends over time
- Views vs likes scatter plot with trendline
- Publishing pattern analysis
- Metric correlation heatmap
- Toggle between **sample data** (offline) and **live YouTube Data API v3** data

---

## How to Run

```powershell
conda activate ml
pip install streamlit plotly google-api-python-client
streamlit run youtube_dashboard.py
```

Jupyter notebooks can be opened with:
```powershell
jupyter notebook
```